#: ../admin/partials/essential-widgets-admin-display.php:121
msgid ""
"Displaying the author’s information is kind of a must-have feature if your "
"website has multiple authors. Our new WordPress widgets plugin allows you "
"to add Authors widget. With this widget, you can show the list of the "
"authors on your website, the number of posts, select feed type, and more."
msgstr ""

