#: ../admin/partials/essential-widgets-admin-display.php:126
msgid ""
"Essential Widgets Pro supports Categories widget. The widget provides you "
"with various customizable options such as the title of the widget, "
"taxonomy option, order option, number of categories to show, display as a "
"list or none, number of posts to display, sort by option, select feed type "
"ton display and display as text or image."
msgstr ""

